  "Theme": "Teema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Siin jagub ruumi vaevu ühele filmile. Ühenda karbi külge USB-ketas — FAT32-ks vormindatud, mida iga Androidi karp aktsepteerib — ja see ilmub üles, et sellele hoopis alla laadida.",
